  "body": "## Summary\n\nThis change updates the Mach3 and Mach4 postprocessors:\n1. Caps Mach3 `sequenceNumberStart` declared option to 99999.\n2. Refuses sequence numbers past 99999 in Mach3 with a named warning.\n3. Adds `G64` modal path mode to the Mach3 header block.\n4. Adds an operator notification comment `(SMOOTHING NOT WRITTEN - MACH4 G64 HAS NO TOLERANCE)` in Mach4 when a smoothing request occurs, using the same pattern as Mach3.\n\n## Readings\n- `assets/posts/mach3.cps`\n- `assets/posts/mach4.cps`\n\n## Pinning tests\n- `crates/post/tests/mach3_post.rs::mach3_header_writes_g64_path_mode`\n- `crates/post/tests/mach3_post.rs::mach3_sequence_numbers_cap_and_refuse_over_99999`\n- `crates/post/tests/mach4_post.rs::mach4_smoothing_request_emits_operator_notification_comment`\n- `crates/post/tests/script_mach3.rs`\n- `crates/post/tests/script_mach4.rs`\n\n## Test organization\n- `crates/post/tests/mach3_post.rs`: Dedicated integration suite for Mach3 post-processor options, safety blocks, and sequence number limits.\n\n## Goldens moved\nReason: header line adds `G64`, #4148 item 2.\n- `crates/post/tests/golden/wcs_flip/mach3_x.nc`\n- `crates/post/tests/recorded/golden/mach3/arcs.nc`\n- `crates/post/tests/recorded/golden/mach3/drill_retract.nc`\n- `crates/post/tests/recorded/golden/mach3/empty_section.nc`\n- `crates/post/tests/recorded/golden/mach3/extreme_coords.nc`\n- `crates/post/tests/recorded/golden/mach3/full_circle.nc`\n- `crates/post/tests/recorded/golden/mach3/full_circle_raw.nc`\n- `crates/app/tests/golden/nc/synth_mach3.nc`\n- `crates/app/tests/golden/nc/mach3/contour_disc_hole.nc`\n- `crates/app/tests/golden/nc/mach3/contour_plate_with_hole.nc`\n- `crates/app/tests/golden/nc/mach3/contour_tangential_lead.nc`\n- `crates/app/tests/golden/nc/mach3/drill_peck.nc`\n- `crates/app/tests/golden/nc/mach3/drill_plate.nc`\n- `crates/app/tests/golden/nc/mach3/face_square_40x40.nc`\n- `crates/app/tests/golden/nc/mach3/face_square_40x40_stepped.nc`\n- `crates/app/tests/golden/nc/mach3/pocket_waterline_plate_with_island.nc`\n- `crates/app/tests/golden/nc/mach3/pocket_zigzag_plate_with_island.nc`\n- `crates/app/tests/golden/nc/mach3/slot_fullwidth_centerline.nc`\n- `crates/app/tests/golden/nc/mach3/slot_wide_channel_rows.nc`\n- `crates/app/tests/golden/nc/mach3/trace_plate_with_hole.nc`\n\n## What was not exercised\n- Machine-tool physical motion on physical controllers.\n\nChangelog: Limit Mach3 sequence numbers, set Mach3 header G64 path mode, and emit Mach4 smoothing notification comment.\n\nFixes #4148\n",
